tensors='pt'           # Return PyTorch tensors\n)\n\ninput_ids = encoded_data['input_ids']\nattention_masks = encoded_data['attention_mask']\n\nprint(f\"\\n✓ Tokenization complete\")\nprint(f\"  Input IDs shape: {input_ids.shape}\")\nprint(f\"  Attention Masks shape: {attention_masks.shape}\")\n\n# View sample tokenization\noriginal_text = sentences[0]\nreview_ids = input_ids[0]\n\nprint(f\"\\n--- Sample BERT Tokenization ---\")\nprint(f\"Original: {original_text}\")\nprint(f\"\\nToken IDs (first 20): {review_ids[:20].tolist()}\")\nprint(f\"\\nDecoded: {tokenizer.decode(review_ids)}\")\n\n# Map sentiment labels to numbers\nlabel_map = {'Positive': 2, 'Neutral': 1, 'Negative': 0}\nnumeric_labels = torch.tensor([label_map.get(l, 1) for l in labels])\n\n# Save prepared data\ndataset = {\n    'input_ids': input_ids,\n    'attention_masks': attention_masks,\n    'labels': numeric_labels\n}\n\ntorch.save(dataset, 'bert_prepared_data.pt')\nprint(f\"\\n✓ Saved prepared data to 'bert_prepared_data.pt'\")","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2025-11-27T13:50:13.600126Z","iopub.execute_input":"2025-11-27T13:50:13.600438Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-11-27T13:50:29.283330Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2025-11-27T13:50:13.600419Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-11-27T13:50:29.282503Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# MODEL ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## MODEL ARCHITECTURE: BERT FOR SEQUENCE CLASSIFICATION\n\n\nBERT (Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers)\n--------------------------------------------------------------\n- Architecture: Transformer Encoder stack (12 layers for base, 24 for large)\n- Key Innovation: Self-Attention Mechanism\n- Bidirectional: Analyzes context from both directions simultaneously\n\nSelf-Attention Mechanism:\n-------------------------\nFor each token, compute attention weights with all other tokens:\n\nAttention(Q,K,V) = softm